WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.500
Start a collection.

00:03.500 --> 00:09.200
Find Pikachu by its printed card number: 25.

00:09.200 --> 00:11.900
Add Pikachu to the wishlist.

00:11.900 --> 00:16.300
Add 2 copies with a Reverse holo finish.

00:16.300 --> 00:19.600
Choose Lightly played condition.

00:19.600 --> 00:23.167
Add a note: “Gift from a friend”.

00:23.167 --> 00:27.167
Save the entry and confirm both copies.

00:27.167 --> 00:35.000
Reopen the app. Your collection still has 1 card and 2 copies.
